Copyright 2026 node9 (node9.ai)

The corpus is built from the third-party works listed below. Each is used
under its own licence, which permits use, change and redistribution (the one
exception is the PyPI download list, which states no licence and of which
only package names and download counts are kept); the licence texts and the
source-specific notices are in sources/<name>/LICENSE and
sources/<name>/NOTICE. The papers behind these works are listed under
`references` in CITATION.cff. Changes made to every work: a sample of its rows
(rules in DATASHEET.md, section 3), each turned into an agent tool call, with
credential- and card-shaped values stored in parts.

